    "Grant permissions to the copy in Applications so they stay associated with the app you use. If you are running from the disk image or Downloads, quit and move the app first." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grant permissions to the copy in Applications so they stay associated with the app you use. If you are running from the disk image or Downloads, quit and move the app first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请给“应用程序”中的副本授权，确保权限对应日常使用的 App。如果正从安装磁盘或“下载”文件夹运行，请先退出并移动 App。"
