    "If machelper is missing from the list, use + to add the app in Applications. If an update leaves the switch on but features still fail, remove the old entry with −, add this copy again and enable it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If machelper is missing from the list, use + to add the app in Applications. If an update leaves the switch on but features still fail, remove the old entry with −, add this copy again and enable it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若列表中没有 machelper，点击 + 添加“应用程序”中的 App。若更新后开关已开启但功能仍无效，请用 − 移除旧条目，再添加当前副本并开启。"
